{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12083","headline":"片玉篇 · 钱起","name":"片玉篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至宝未爲代所奇，韫灵示[璞]荆山陲。\n独使虹光天子识，不将清韵世人知。\n世人所贵惟燕石，美玉对之成瓦砾。\n空山埋照凡几年，古色苍痕宛自然。\n重溪幂幂暗云树，一片荧荧光石泉。\n美人之鉴明且彻，玉指提携叹奇绝。\n试劳香袖拂莓苔，不觉清心皎冰雪。\n连城美价幸逢时，命代良工岂见遗。\n试作珪璋礼天地，何如瓀𤨟在堦墀","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}